How to cite
-----------

For each file, cite the primary publication listed in data/index.json
whenever one is given. If no primary publication is listed, cite the
page the file backs on coleoguy.github.io and the date of download.

For the karyotype records, please also cite the original sources listed
in the per-file citation column. These are the papers that actually did
the cytogenetic work.

